e":"At today's $BORRO price and deposits. Changes as others deposit and as the price moves. Vests over 30 days. Shared 60% to stock lenders and 40% to USDG lenders by deposit value."},"schema_version":1,"market_clock":{"open":true,"closes_at":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z","reopens_at":null,"rule":"While the market is shut the Chainlink feeds pause at their last print and every contract keeps using it. Borro's site sizes a new short at the top of the weekend band and values posted stock at its bottom (the weekend tool, /weekend.json); the contracts do not enforce that."}}
